            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nHaving looked at it, I do agree that this might be a bit much. And as 'mini.sessions' is designed to support the workflow you describe, it is reasonable to loosen the side effect from error to a message. This should be done on latest `main` branch.",
